WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.724
This slide focuses on Update a dictionary Start with
the meaning of the idea then

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:11.585
connect it to the example and the larger analytical
workflow Dictionaries

00:00:11.598 --> 00:00:16.785
are mutable We can add a new key change an existing
value or remove a

00:00:16.798 --> 00:00:22.732
key-value pair Assignment adds or updates a key pop
removes

00:00:22.758 --> 00:00:28.393
a key and returns its value Before running the
example predict

00:00:28.419 --> 00:00:33.369
what the output should look like Run it in the
browser inspect the result then

00:00:33.396 --> 00:00:38.896
change one input key value or condition and run it
again Focus on what

00:00:38.909 --> 00:00:44.430
changed and why Updates are useful when records
change over time

00:00:45.367 --> 00:00:47.578
Add change and remove keys
